# Milestone 2022, PaLM (Chowdhery et al., 2022): parallel blocks, multi-query attention,
# RoPE on every dim, SwiGLU, and no biases in any projection or norm; the head stays
# tied, as PaLM's. Heads of 64 and a layer for every 64 of the width, where PaLM has
# heads of 256; its SwiGLU is 4 times as wide as the stream, this one 8/3 (to the nearest
# 64), as many parameters as GPT-3's MLP.
d_model    = 768
vocab_size = 50304
layers     = d_model // 64

swiglu_width = (8 * d_model + 96) // 192 * 64

palm_norm = layernorm(eps=1e-5)
palm_attn = gqa(num_heads=d_model // 64, num_kv_heads=1, rope=rope())
palm_ffn  = gated_mlp(intermediate_size=swiglu_width, activation=swish)

palm  = embed [palm_norm (palm_attn + palm_ffn)]^layers palm_norm head(tied=true)
model = palm
